n go straight to the cold."}</p><figure><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1499x829.svg"} alt={"The outdoor cold plunge: a dark stone basin with a wooden ladder under the olive trees"} width={"1499"} height={"829"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><figcaption>{"The plunge sits outdoors under the olives, a few steps from the sauna door."}</figcaption></figure><h2>{"The cold is shorter than you think"}</h2><p>{"Thirty seconds is enough on your first round. Walk in by the ladder, breathe out slowly, and count. By the third round most guests stay a full minute and climb out smiling. If the plunge is too much today, the cool shower beside it does most of the work."}</p><blockquote><p>{"“The rest is not the break between the good parts. The rest is the good part.”"}</p></blockquote><h2>{"Then do nothing"}</h2><p>{"This is the step guests skip. After the cold, wrap up in your robe and lie down in the lounge for ten minutes. Drink a glass of water. Your heart slows, your skin warms from the inside, and you feel the round settle."}</p><ul className={"custom-list"} role={"list"}><li>{"Three rounds take about an hour"}</li><li>{"The warm pool fits anywhere in between"}</li><li>{"Eat lightly before you come, and drink water after each round"}</li><li>{"Pregnant, or a heart condition? Talk to us before the heat"}</li></ul><p>{"Then come and find me at the desk and tell me how it went. I always want to know."}</p></div></div></article><section id={"sp-ar-more"} className={"bg-soft py-[var(--section-space)]"} aria-labelledby={"sp-ar-more-title"}><div className={"container"}><div className={"mb-12 grid gap-6 lg:mb-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-end"}><div className={"grid gap-5"}><p className={"eyebrow m-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Further Reading"}</p><h2 id={"sp-ar-more-title"} className={"custom-title"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"80"}>{"More from the "}<em>{"house."}</em></h2></div><a href={"#page=demo-spa-1-blo